flowchart TD
    A[Settings > Integrations] --> B[Select Netskope tile]
    B --> C[Connect wizard Step 1: Tenant URL, API Token]
    C --> D[Connect wizard Step 2: test connection & detect read/write capabilities]
    D --> E{Capability result?}
    E -- Zero categories accessible --> F[Blocked: error message, cannot proceed]
    F --> A
    E -- Full or partial capability --> G[Connect wizard Step 3: set sync cadence]
    G --> H[Confirm & activate integration]
    H --> I[Redirect to Configure Risk Score Weights]
    I --> J[One-time callout + recommended default weights shown, grouped into 3 clusters]
    J --> K[Admin adjusts category weights via slider or numeric input]
    K --> L[No Netskope Visibility row always present below second divider]
    K --> M[Click Estimate impact - async preview]
    M --> K
    K --> N[Click Save]
    N --> O{Would save cross a Smart Group threshold or fire an Adaptive Workflow?}
    O -- Yes --> P[Cascade warning modal: plain-language impact summary]
    P -- Cancel --> K
    P -- Save Anyway --> Q[Weights saved]
    O -- No --> Q[Weights saved]
    Q --> R[Toast: applies starting next sync]

    A --> S[Open Share Risk Signals with Netskope]
    S --> T{Token has write scope?}
    T -- No --> U[Page locked: instructions to update token scope and reconnect]
    T -- Yes --> V[Admin enables master toggle]
    V --> W{Is Behavior Confidence currently active?}
    W -- Yes --> X[Confirmation modal: explains circular-dependency, Behavior Confidence will turn off]
    X -- Cancel --> S
    X -- Turn on Share Risk Signals --> Y[Behavior Confidence disabled on Weights page; master toggle commits]
    W -- No --> Y
    Y --> Z[Admin toggles individual signals: Training Overdue, Simulation Failure, Overall Risk Tier]
    Z --> AA[Click Save]
    AA --> AB[Toast: signals share starting next sync]

    R --> AC[Scheduled sync runs]
    AB --> AC
    AC --> AD[Risk scores recompute with new weights; selected signals pushed to Netskope UCI]
    AD --> AE[Admin views user risk score breakdown]
    AE --> AF[Netskope source section: per-category badges + delta, translated from UCI scale]

    AC --> AG{Sync/push outcome?}
    AG -- Ingestion success --> AD
    AG -- Ingestion partial category failure --> AH[Affected category flagged, others recompute normally]
    AG -- Ingestion credential/connection failure --> AI[Connection error badge, scores hold at last-known values]
    AG -- Push failure --> AJ[Push delayed status on Share Risk Signals page]
    AG -- License downgrade removes a category --> AK[Category moves to No longer available section]

    A --> AL[Open Review User Mapping]
    AL --> AM{Match status per Netskope identity}
    AM -- Auto-matched via SCIM/SSO identity --> AN[Contributes to that user's score]
    AM -- Unmatched --> AO[Appears in mapping table for manual link]
    AO --> AP[Admin links to a Dune user via drawer]
    AP --> AN
    AM -- No Netskope data for a Dune user --> AQ[Scored under No Netskope Visibility]

    I --> AR[Admin sets all weights to 0%]
    AR --> AS[Non-blocking banner suggests disconnect instead]

    S --> AT[Admin disables Share Risk Signals master toggle after active use]
    AT --> AU[Confirmation modal: past pushed data cannot be retracted from Netskope]
    AU -- Cancel --> S
    AU -- Turn off --> AV[Write-back stops; historical influence in Netskope remains]

    A --> AW[Admin disconnects integration]
    AW --> AX[Confirmation modal: historical contributions freeze; past pushed data cannot be retracted if Share Risk Signals was active]
    AX -- Cancel --> A
    AX -- Disconnect --> AY[Integration disconnected, scores hold at last computed value]
